#The Sandwich 

## Assumptions 
- The bread, the peanut butter jar, and knife are all present .

## Steps 
- open jar of peanut butter 
- pick up knife 
- remove the fucking seal with the fucking knife 
- place knife back on table
- remove twist tie from bread
- pick up bread bag and unfold top 
- place bread bag back on table 
- reach in and remove loaf from bread bag  
- pick up knife 
- use knife to cut two slices of bread  
- use knife and remove a small of peanut butter out of jar 
- take one piece of bread 
- spread peanut butter on bread 
- put knife back on table
- take second piece of bread and place it on the bread with peanut butter on it. 




